---
title: Research
permalink: /research/
layout: layouts/default.njk
description: "Research at the UWA NLP-TLP Group, in four themes: technical language processing, knowledge graphs and ontologies, annotation and tooling, and language models and reasoning."
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Research
  order: 2
---

<p class="page-intro">
	Our work runs from the raw text an engineer types into a work order through
	to a knowledge graph an organisation can reason over. It sits in four
	themes; each one collects the papers, talks and software that came out of it.
</p>

<ul class="theme-cards">
	{% for theme in themes %}
		{%- set papers = collections.publications | inTheme(theme.groups) %}
		{%- set talks = collections.presentations | inTheme(theme.groups) %}
		{%- set demos = collections.software_demos | demosOfTheme(theme.demos) %}
		<li class="theme-card-large">
			<h2><a href="/research/{{ theme.slug }}/">{{ theme.name }}</a></h2>
			<p>{{ theme.blurb }}</p>
			<p class="theme-card-counts">
				{{ papers.length }} publication{% if papers.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}
				{%- if talks.length %}, {{ talks.length }} talk{% if talks.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}
				{%- if demos.length %}, {{ demos.length }} system{% if demos.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}
			</p>
		</li>
	{% endfor %}
</ul>

{%- set orphanPapers = collections.publications | notInAnyTheme(themes) %}
{%- set orphanTalks = collections.presentations | notInAnyTheme(themes) %}
{% if orphanPapers.length or orphanTalks.length %}
	<section class="theme-section" id="other">
		<h2>Other work</h2>
		<ul class="publications-list">
		{% for item in orphanPapers %}
			<li>
				<div class="publication-title">
					{% if item.data.url %}<a href="{{ item.data.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.data.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ item.data.title }}{% endif %}
				</div>
				<div class="publication-authors">{{ item.data.authors }}</div>
				<div class="publication-venue">{{ item.data.venue }}</div>
			</li>
		{% endfor %}
		{% for item in orphanTalks %}
			<li>
				<div class="publication-title"><a href="{{ item.data.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.data.title }}</a></div>
				<div class="publication-authors">{{ item.data.authors }}</div>
			</li>
		{% endfor %}
		</ul>
	</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="theme-section" id="current-projects">
	<h2>Current projects</h2>
	<p class="theme-blurb">
		Work under way now, with the students and partners doing it.
	</p>
	{% for group, items in collections.current_research | groupby("data.group") %}
		<h3 class="theme-subheading">{{ group }}</h3>
		{% for item in items %}
			<article class="research-article">
				<h4>{{ item.data.name }}</h4>
				{% if item.data.authors %}<p class="research-authors">{{ item.data.authors }}</p>{% endif %}
				<p>{{ item.data.description | safe }}</p>
			</article>
		{% endfor %}
	{% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="theme-section" id="seminars">
	<h2>Seminars</h2>
	{% for item in collections.seminars %}
		<article class="research-article">
			<h3>{{ item.data.title }}</h3>
			<p class="research-authors">
				Facilitated by {{ item.data.facilitated_by }}{% if item.data.seminar_date %}, {{ item.data.seminar_date }}{% endif %}{% if item.data.venue %}, {{ item.data.venue }}{% endif %}
			</p>
			{{ item.content | safe }}
		</article>
	{% endfor %}
</section>
